B.a_E=s(["Fabrika ve tarlalar\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 Jeotermal Kapl\u0131can\u0131n etraf\u0131na dizerek k\u0131\u015f odun t\xfcketimini s\u0131f\u0131rlay\u0131n."],t.s)
