B.Rw=new A.bx("bld_lumberjack",B.as,"Oduncu Kul\xfcbesi (Kereste Tedari\u011fi)","Lumberjack Hut (Timber Logging)","Ormandan ham odun keser. K\u0131\u015f\u0131n binalar\u0131 \u0131s\u0131tmak ve in\u015faat yapmak i\xe7in hayati kaynakt\u0131r.","Harvests raw timber from forests. Essential for winter heating and construction.","Oduncu Kul\xfcbesi, Orman karolar\u0131na kurulur ve saniyede 0.35 Odun keser. Odun, hem k\u0131\u015f ayaz\u0131nda donan binalar\u0131 \u0131s\u0131tmak hem de H\u0131zar Ota\u011f\u0131nda kalas bi\xe7mek i\xe7in vazge\xe7ilmez yak\u0131tt\u0131r.","Built on Forest hexes, harvesting 0.35 Wood/sec for construction and winter heating.",B.S6,B.eQ,"SV.1 | ORMAN",B.a1U,B.I,B.I,B.Z4,B.a_8,B.V9)
