B.RA=new A.bx("lore_steppe_tree",B.pt,"Orhun Bitig A\u011fac\u0131 & Bilgelik Ta\u015f\u0131","Orhun Lore Tree & Wisdom Stele","R\xfcnik Yaz\u0131t Ta\u015f\u0131 dikerek kazan\u0131lan Bilgelik (Wisdom) puanlar\u0131yla 4 kadim uzmanl\u0131k dal\u0131n\u0131 geli\u015ftirin.","Construct Runic Steles to generate Wisdom and unlock 4 ancient talent branches.","Bozk\u0131r R\xfcnik Yaz\u0131tlar\u0131 dikildi\u011finde zamanla Bilgelik (Wisdom) puan\u0131 \xfcretir. Sa\u011f ara\xe7 \xe7ubu\u011fundaki Kitap simgesiyle a\xe7\u0131lan Orhun Bitig A\u011fac\u0131 4 daldan olu\u015fur:\n\n1. Ak\u0131nc\u0131 Lojisti\u011fi: \u0130\u015f\xe7i menzili (+1 Hex) ve kervan h\u0131z\u0131 (+%25).\n2. \u0130klim & Ke\xe7e Zanaat\u0131: \xc7ad\u0131r yal\u0131t\u0131m\u0131 ve Zud dondurma s\xfcresi geciktirme.\n3. Toprak S\u0131rr\u0131: Nadas dinlenme s\xfcresini yar\u0131ya indirme ve +%50 bereket.\n4. Bozk\u0131r D\xf6k\xfcmc\xfcl\xfc\u011f\xfc: \u015eam \xc7eli\u011fi filizlenme \u015fans\u0131 ve maden patlamalar\u0131.","Runic Steles generate Wisdom points. Spend them in the Orhun Lore Tree across 4 branches: Logistics, Weathercraft, Soil Mastery, and Metallurgy.",B.vK,B.by,"4 B\u0130LGEL\u0130K DALI",B.a2p,B.Zn,B.XN,B.Yr,B.YC,B.a_K)
