B.RG=new A.bx("core_conquest",B.jd,"Karo Ke\u015ffi & Fetih (Sis A\xe7ma & \xdcssel Maliyet)","Hex Conquest & Exponential Scaling","Kom\u015fu karolara yay\u0131larak s\u0131n\u0131rlar\u0131 geni\u015fletin. Fetih maliyeti 1.6 kat \xfcssel \xe7arpanla artar.","Expand territory by conquering adjacent tiles. Cost scales exponentially at 1.6^N with total owned tiles.",'Haritada sahip olunan arazilerin s\u0131n\u0131r kom\u015fular\u0131 "Ke\u015ffedildi" (Discovered) durumuna ge\xe7er ve sis da\u011f\u0131l\u0131r. Fethetti\u011finiz her yeni karo i\xe7in gereken G\u0131da maliyeti 1.6 kat geometrik olarak artar (Maliyet = Taban * 1.6^karo * BiyomYo\u011funlu\u011fu * (1 - \u0130ndirim)).\n\nBu \xfcssel art\u0131\u015f nedeniyle 20-25 karodan sonra yeni toprak fethetmek milyonlarca g\u0131daya mal olur. Buras\u0131 bir t\u0131kanma noktas\u0131 de\u011fil, B\xfcy\xfck G\xf6\xe7 (Prestij) yaparak Atalar Tamgas\u0131 kazanma ve yeni diyara daha g\xfc\xe7l\xfc g\xf6\xe7 etme zaman\u0131d\u0131r.',"Adjacent hexes become discovered. Conquering tiles costs Food, scaling exponentially at 1.6^N with each conquered tile. Beyond 20-25 tiles, costs rise into millions, signaling the time to trigger a Great Migration for Tamga multipliers.",B.vH,B.Q,"FET\u0130H & S\u0130S",B.a1y,B.ZN,B.a_e,B.XY,B.a_9,B.X8)
