B.RS=new A.bx("bld_pasture",B.as,"Bozk\u0131r Otla\u011f\u0131 / Mera (Hayvanc\u0131l\u0131k)","Steppe Pasture (Livestock)","At ve koyun s\xfcr\xfclerinin otlat\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 mera. Y\xfcksek ia\u015fe, k\u0131srak s\xfct\xfc ve y\xfcn sa\u011flar.","Grazing pasture for horses and sheep. Yields food, mare milk, and wool.","Bozk\u0131r Otla\u011f\u0131, g\xf6\xe7ebe ya\u015fam\u0131n atardamar\u0131d\u0131r. Saniyede 0.48 G\u0131da \xfcretir. Ke\xe7e \xc7ad\u0131r At\xf6lyesi ve K\u0131m\u0131z Ota\u011f\u0131 i\xe7in hammadde ak\u0131\u015f\u0131 sa\u011flar. Zamanla otlar t\xfckendi\u011finde yaylak nadas\u0131na b\u0131rak\u0131larak dinlendirilebilir.","Steppe Pasture houses horses and herds, producing 0.48 Food/sec. Supplies wool and milk.",B.SJ,B.F,"SV.2 | \xc7AYIR",B.a1M,B.I,B.I,B.Yb,B.ZS,B.ZD)
