B.a1D=new A.am(B.m2,["HexRush Khaganate","Food","Wood","Flour","Plank","Bread","Furniture","Stone","Iron","Glory / Renown","Land","Spring","Summer","Autumn","Winter","Spring Has Arrived","Summer Has Begun","Autumn Harvest Has Begun","Winter Frost Has Fallen","WARNING: Severe Zud Blizzard!","Herds thrive, pasture fertility surges","Food and grain production at peak","Wood and lumber yield +25%, harvest time","Frost and cold: Food yields reduced by 50%","Critical blizzard: All production reduced by 40%!","Year","Conquer Land","Cost","FREE","Build","Upgrade","Collect","Level","/s","10x Steppe Surge","Settings","Privacy Policy","Language","Sound","Mute","Reset Game","Khan's Yurt","The heart of your steppe realm. Expands traditions and unlocks new structures.","Global Speed Bonus","Next Unlock","Meadow","Forest","Mountain","Sea","Desert","Tundra","Volcano","Wetlands","Celestial Crater","Celestial Crater","Ancestral Kurgan","Ancestral Kurgan","Crystal Chasm","Crystal Chasm","Wheat Field","Produces staple wheat and provisions.","Barley Field","Frost-resilient steppe grain that yields in cold weather.","Steppe Pasture","Grazing herds and steppe horses; high food and meat yield.","Steppe Orchard","Wild fruits that surge in summer and autumn.","Stone Quarry","Excavates pure stone blocks for khaganate construction.","Birch & Resin Camp","Harvests high quality birch timber and yurt insulation.","Lumberjack Camp","Produces timber.","Windmill","Converts Food into Flour.","Sawmill Works","Converts Wood into Planks.","Stone Hearth Bakery","Produces Bread from Flour & Food.","Carpenter Lodge","Produces Furniture from Planks.","Worker Hut","Automates resource collection.","Defense Watchtower","3-Hex range archer tower; automatically shoots approaching enemies.","Mine Quarry","Produces Stone and Iron.","Wooden Bridge","Allows crossing water tiles.","Fisherman","Produces food from water tiles.","Fisherman Hut","Collection point for fishermen.","Oasis Cistern","Clears drought and gives +40% fertility aura.","Silk Road Caravanserai","Trades goods for bread and wealth.","Desert Astrolabe","Maps desert stars for celestial guidance.","Reindeer Sanctuary","Produces frost-resilient food and warmth.","Geothermal Bath","Doubles worker speed with warm spring steam.","Permafrost Dig","Excavates mammoth fossils and iron ore.","Steam Vent Dynamo","Generates steam pressure and stone.","Obsidian Master Forge","Forges obsidian-hardened tools and iron.","Herbalist Yurt","Brews nourishing remedies from wetland flora.","Reed Scribe Workshop","Crafts ancient scrolls and planks.","Celestial Anvil","Forges rare Meteoric Steel from fallen meteorites.","Ancestral Totem","Channels cumulative migration heritage.","Prismatic Resonator","Doubles the power of all sacred shrines.","Granary Vault & Storehouse","Specialized food logistics storehouse providing 10x transfer capacity for food supplies.","Kumis Yurt","Ferments mare milk to brew traditional steppe kumis.","Felt Tent Workshop","Processes raw wool into sturdy felt for yurts and commerce.","Damascus Master Forge","Forges Damascus steel ingots through layered metallurgy.","Orkhon Runic Stele","Inscribes ancient steppe knowledge to generate Lore for the T\xf6re tree.","Steppe Bazaar","Trade goods for stone, iron, and glory.","Trade","T\xf6re & Council","Empower your realm with ancient traditions and titles.","Learn","Claim Title","Warm (+50% Speed)","Requires Yurt Lv.{0}","Hauling Capacity","Utilized","Idle","Logistics Load","Capacity","{0} Production Buildings in Range","Production & Consumption Breakdown","Total Production","Total Consumption","Net Balance","Gross Production Rate","Net Transported Income","Logistics Bottleneck","Surplus production is accumulating due to limited hauling capacity or being out of 4-hex range. Build Worker Huts or Granary Vaults to increase capacity.","PRODUCERS","CONSUMERS","No active buildings producing or consuming this resource.","HEXPEDIA - STEPPE ENCYCLOPEDIA","Search mechanics, buildings or biomes...","MECHANIC STATS & FORMULAS","STEP-BY-STEP GUIDE","TACTICAL STEPPE TIPS","No matching mechanics or guides found.","WELCOME, KHAGAN OF THE STEPPE","Cancel","Confirm","Yes","No","Close","SKIP","PREV","NEXT","BEGIN ADVENTURE","DAWN OF THE STEPPE","Great Migration & Realm Renewal","Confirm Great Migration","All buildings and resources will reset, but you will earn Crowns and Tamgas for permanent bonuses. Do you want to proceed?","YES, START MIGRATION","CROWNS TO EARN","ANCESTRAL TAMGA","GLORY MULTIPLIER","MIGRANT MEMORY","TOTAL MIGRATIONS","TAMGA COUNT","PERMANENT BONUS","No Great Migration completed yet.\nYour migration history will be saved here after your first migration.","STEPPE RAID","RAID INFO & DEFENSE STRATEGY","SOUND EFFECTS","STEPPE MUSIC","ON","OFF","NOTIFICATION PREFERENCES","Storage Full Alert (80%)","Season Change Alert","Quest Complete Alert","Yurt Upgrade Ready Alert","NEO-BRUTALIST THEME PALETTE","GREAT MIGRATION SCREEN","STEPPE EPIC (INTRO STORY)","CLAIMING REWARD","Claiming reward, please wait...","RENOWN & CROWN BREAKDOWN","Great Migration Reset Calculation","STEPPE DIORAMA SNAPSHOT","Diorama snapshot saved to gallery!","REALM SELECTION","T\xd6RE WISDOM TREE","Wisdom","Claim","Claimed","Locked","Unlock","EQUIPPED","EQUIP","ACTIVE","INACTIVE","hours","minutes","seconds","OWNED","WILD","ANCIENT STEPPE MATRIX","Activating Isometric Voxel Engine...","LOADING","ORHUN BITIG STONES & LORE TREE","BITIG","Logistics","Heating","Soil","Casting","UNLOCKED","SILK ROAD ENVOY ORDERS","No pending envoy orders at this time.","DELIVERED","DELIVER ORDER","ACTIVE REALM","SELECT THIS REALM","ALTAI CELESTIAL PLATEAUS","Abundance of Mines, Quarries & Damascus Steel","\u2022 Stone, Iron and Damascus Steel production doubled.\n\u2022 30% discount on Mountain and Crater tile conquest costs.\n\u2022 Harsh winters and high Kurgan legacy synergy.","VOLGA-URAL RIVER BASIN","Abundance of Fishing, Wetlands & Kumis Yurt","\u2022 Fish, Food, Flour and Kumis production doubled.\n\u2022 30% discount on Sea and Reed tile conquest costs.\n\u2022 +50% prosperity resonance adjacent to rivers and lakes.","KARAKUM & TARIM OASES","Silk Road Caravans, Market Barter & Felt Abundance","\u2022 Caravan speed, Market barter profits and Crown yield doubled.\n\u2022 Felt and yurt production is 50% faster.\n\u2022 25% discount on Desert and Oasis tile conquest costs.","CONFIRM GREAT MIGRATION?","Your current lands and resources will be reset; your tribe will migrate to a new era.\n\nLegacy to Earn:\n\u2022 +{0} Crowns (Renown & Glory)\n\u2022 +{1} Permanent Ancestral Tamga\n\u2022 Your buildings will turn into Ancestral Kurgans.\n\nAre you sure you want to proceed?","GREAT MIGRATION (PRESTIGE & KUT MULTIPLIER)","Eternal Steppe Victory Cycle & Heritage Multiplier","PERMANENT LEGACY TO EARN IN THIS MIGRATION","LEGACY & REWARD BREAKDOWN","SACRED OATHS (CHALLENGE MODIFIERS)","TARGET EXPEDITION REALM SELECTION","Resources","ETERNAL REALM VICTORIES:","Orkhon Runic Steles (Cultural)","Great Silk Road Network (Logistics)","4 Ancient Realm Dominance (Geographic)","Oath of Steel (+15% Glory)","Iron & mine progression boost \u2022 Extra Tamga yield","Oath of Permafrost (+15% Glory)","Resilience against harsh winter & Zud blizzards","Great Steppe (Standard)","Balanced meadows, forests & mineral basins","Silk Road Oases","Desert biomes, caravanserai & trade boost","Altay Highlands","Tundra & geothermal baths frost challenge","Realm not ready for migration (Requires Yurt Lv. 5 & 12 Tiles)","Requires Yurt Lv. 5 and 12 Tiles for Migration.","START GREAT MIGRATION","MIGRATION LOCKED","SELECTED","MIGRATION MULTIPLIERS & GUIDE","POST-MIGRATION REWARDS & GAINS SUMMARY","Global Production Speed (Kut)","Worker & Granary Carry Volume","Permanent Ancestral Tamgas","Glory Crowns to Gain","Permanent Logistics & Carry (+35% / Migration)","Every Great Migration permanently boosts the carrying capacity of all worker huts and granaries by +35% x Total Migrations. Logistics automatically scales with your multiplying production and eliminates transport bottlenecks.","Kut Blessing & Production Multiplier (Heavenly Grace)","Kut Blessing directly multiplies the baseline production speed of ALL resources (wheat, wood, stone, iron, flour, bread, etc.) in your new settlement. Every 1 Tamga = +4% Production Speed, every Migration = +5% Permanent Kut, every Great Victory = +25% Kut.","How to Earn Multipliers & Crowns?","Khan Yurt: Lv. 5+ unlocks migration. Every 2 Yurt levels = +1 Crown.","Land Conquest: Every 20 conquered hex tiles and each Ancient Shrine (+5 pts) = +1 Ancestral Tamga.","Building Investment: Every 15 total building levels = +1 Crown.","Ancient Shrines: Every discovered Ancient Shrine = +1 Crown & holy logistics/production aura.","Prosperity Stock: High stored warehouse resources (5K - 500K) = +1 to +4 Extra Crowns.","Fish","Kumis","Felt","Damascus Steel","STEPPE OFFLINE GAINS","Offline steppe gains transferred to storage.","With steppe blessing, 2.0x doubled offline gains transferred to storage!","Swift Horse Courier","Expands worker transport range by +1 Hex and increases caravan speed by +25%.","Silk Road Network","Increases caravan trade synergy by +50%.","Khaganate Postal System","Doubles worker transport capacity across the entire map.","Thick Felt Weaving","Reduces heating wood cost for frozen tiles by 30% in winter.","Hearth Fire Gathering","Increases winter production multiplier of heated tiles by +40%.","Zud Resilience","Halves the negative production penalty of Zud blizzards.","Seasonal Pasture Migration","Doubles soil health regeneration rate on fallow meadows (2x).","Blessed Seed Breeding","Increases base harvest yield on all fields and orchards by +35%.","Soil Respiration Burst","Triples the respiration burst multiplier of rested soil (3x).","Bellows Forge Refinement","Increases ore and iron extraction speed from mines by +30%.","Damascus Steel Secret","Increases Damascus Steel foundry efficiency by +50%.","Modu Chanyu Bows & Blades","Doubles global yield of all mining and crafting structures (2x).","ECONOMICS","MILITARY","NOMADIC","WILDCARD","ACCUMULATED STOCK:","ESTABLISH SILK ROAD CARAVAN ROUTE","Origin","CONNECTED","CONNECT","ERECT BENG\xdc STELE (+10 Tamga, +25% Kut)","LINK SILK ROAD (+10 Tamga, +25% Kut)","UNIFY REALMS (+15 Tamga, +25% Kut)","Goal: Declare Eternal Victory with 500 Lore or 4 Caravan Routes.","CLAIMING REWARD","Claiming reward, please wait...","DIORAMA & REALM SEAL","STEPPE KHAGANATE DIORAMA","FULLSCREEN DIORAMA","Conquered: {0} Tiles","Zuds Survived: {0}","Highest Yield: {0}","SACRED LEGACY CHEST","Increase ancestral tamgas by +1 to start the new era stronger.","TIME TO MIGRATE!","SACRED MIGRATION TIME HAS COME!","First era complete \u2022 Growth is slowing","Your realm reached its first borders. Start Great Migration now to earn permanent Tamgas and Kut Multipliers!","LATER","MIGRATE NOW","GLORY & CROWN BREAKDOWN","CURRENT CROWNS","TO EARN IN MIGRATION","CROWN CALCULATION & YIELD DETAILS","STEPPE RAID: LEVEL {0}","REMAINING ENEMIES: {0}","RAID HORN: LEVEL {0}","Yurt Damaged (Repair Needed)","Highest: Level {0}","Challenge Steppe Raiders","REPAIR YURT","STEPPE NOMAD","REALM CONQUEROR","SILK ROAD MERCHANT","ZUD MASTER","GREAT KHAGAN","G\xd6K TENGR\u0130: RAIN BLESSING","TONYUKUK: SILK WEB","TONYUKUK: STONE ROADS","K\xdcL T\u0130G\u0130N: BRAVE HEART","Envoy: {0} \u2022 Reward: {1}x Gold Rush Speed ({2} min)"],t.w)
B.a1C=new A.am(B.m2,["Kaganato HexRush","Comida","Madera","Harina","Tabl\xf3n","Pan","Muebles","Piedra","Hierro","Gloria / Rango","Tierra","Primavera","Verano","Oto\xf1o","Invierno","La Primavera Ha Llegado","El Verano Ha Comenzado","Ha Comenzado la Cosecha de Oto\xf1o","Ha Llegado el Fr\xedo Invierno","\xa1ATENCI\xd3N: Tormenta de Zud!","Los reba\xf1os prosperan y brotan los pastos","Producci\xf3n de comida y trigo al m\xe1ximo","Rendimiento de madera +25%, tiempo de cosecha","Helada y fr\xedo: Producci\xf3n de comida reducida al 50%","Tormenta cr\xedtica: \xa1Toda la producci\xf3n reducida en un 40%!","A\xf1o","Conquistar","Coste","GRATIS","Construir","Mejorar","Recoger","Nivel","/s","10x Frenes\xed de Estepa","Ajustes","Pol\xedtica de Privacidad","Idioma","Sonido","Silenciar","Reiniciar Juego","Yurta del Kan","El coraz\xf3n de tu estepa. Desbloquea tradiciones y nuevos edificios.","Bonus de Velocidad Global","Pr\xf3ximo Desbloqueo","Prado","Bosque","Monta\xf1a","Mar","Desierto","Tundra","Volc\xe1n","Humedal","Cr\xe1ter Celestial","Cr\xe1ter Celestial","Kurgan Ancestral","Kurgan Ancestral","Abismo de Cristal","Abismo de Cristal","Campo de Trigo","Produce trigo y provisiones b\xe1sicas.","Campo de Cebada","Cereal resistente al fr\xedo.","Pasto de Estepa","Reba\xf1os y caballos de estepa; alta producci\xf3n de carne.","Huerto de Frutas","Frutas silvestres que prosperan en verano y oto\xf1o.","Cantera de Piedra","Extrae bloques de piedra para la construcci\xf3n.","Campamento de Resina","Madera de abedul y resina para yurtas.","Campamento de Le\xf1adores","Produce madera.","Molino de Viento","Convierte Comida en Harina.","Taller de Aserradero","Convierte Madera en Tablones.","Horno de Piedra","Produce Pan.","Taller de Carpinter\xeda","Produce Muebles.","Caba\xf1a de Obreros","Transporta recursos autom\xe1ticamente.","Torre de Defensa","Torre de arqueros con alcance de 3 hex\xe1gonos; ataca enemigos autom\xe1ticamente.","Mina","Extrae Piedra y Hierro.","Puente de Madera","Permite cruzar el mar.","Pescador","Produce comida en el agua.","Caba\xf1a de Pesca","Punto de recogida para pescadores.","Cisterna de Oasis","Elimina la sequ\xeda y brinda un aura de +40%.","Caravasar de la Ruta de la Seda","Comercia bienes por pan y provisiones.","Astrolabio del Desierto","Mapea las estrellas del desierto.","Santuario de Renos","Produce comida y calor resistentes al fr\xedo.","Ba\xf1o Geot\xe9rmico","Duplica la velocidad de los obreros.","Excavaci\xf3n Permafrost","Extrae f\xf3siles de mamut y mineral de hierro.","Ventila de Vapor","Genera presi\xf3n de vapor y piedra.","Forja de Obsidiana","Forja herramientas de obsidiana y hierro.","Yurta del Herbolario","Elabora alimentos curativos del humedal.","Taller de Escribas","Elabora pergaminos antiguos y tablones.","Yunque Celestial","Forja Acero Mete\xf3rico a partir de meteoritos.","T\xf3tem Ancestral","Canaliza el poder de todas las migraciones.","Resonador Prism\xe1tico","Duplica el poder de todos los santuarios sagrados.","Granero y Almac\xe9n","Almac\xe9n log\xedstico de alimentos con capacidad de transferencia 10x.","Yurta de Kumis","Fermenta leche de yegua para producir kumis tradicional.","Taller de Fieltro","Procesa lana en fieltro resistente para yurtas y comercio.","Forja de Damasco","Forja acero de Damasco de alta calidad mediante capas.","Estela R\xfanica de Orj\xf3n","Inscribe conocimientos ancestrales y genera sabidur\xeda para el \xe1rbol T\xf6re.","Bazar de la Estepa","Comercia bienes por piedra, hierro y gloria.","Comerciar","T\xf6re y Consejo","Fortalece tu reino con tradiciones ancestrales.","Aprender","Reclamar T\xedtulo","Calentar (+50%)","Requiere Yurta Nivel {0}","Capacidad de Carga","En Uso","Inactivo","Carga Log\xedstica","Capacidad","{0} Edificios Productivos en Rango","Desglose de Producci\xf3n y Consumo","Producci\xf3n Total","Consumo Total","Balance Neto","Tasa de Producci\xf3n Bruta","Ingreso Neto Transportado","Cuello de Botella Log\xedstico","El exceso de producci\xf3n se acumula debido a la capacidad de transporte limitada. Construye Caba\xf1as de Obreros o B\xf3vedas de Granero.","PRODUCTORES","CONSUMIDORES","No hay edificios activos produciendo o consumiendo este recurso.","HEXPEDIA - ENCICLOPEDIA DE LA ESTEPA","Buscar mec\xe1nicas, edificios o biomas...","ESTAD\xcdSTICAS Y F\xd3RMULAS","GU\xcdA PASO A PASO","CONSEJOS T\xc1CTICOS","No se encontraron mec\xe1nicas coincidentes.","BIENVENIDO, KAN DE LA ESTEPA","Cancelar","Confirmar","S\xed","No","Cerrar","OMITIR","ANTERIOR","SIGUIENTE","COMENZAR AVENTURA","EL AMANECER DE LA ESTEPA","Gran Migraci\xf3n y Renacimiento","Confirmar Gran Migraci\xf3n","Se reiniciar\xe1n todos los edificios y recursos, pero ganar\xe1s Coronas y Tamgas para bonificaciones permanentes. \xbfQuieres continuar?","S\xcd, INICIAR MIGRACI\xd3N","CORONAS A GANAR","TAMGA ANCESTRAL","MULTIPLICADOR DE GLORIA","MEMORIA MIGRANTE","MIGRACIONES TOTALES","CANTIDAD DE TAMGAS","BONIFICACI\xd3N PERMANENTE","A\xfan no se ha completado ninguna Gran Migraci\xf3n.\nTu historial se guardar\xe1 aqu\xed tras la primera.","INCURSI\xd3N EN LA ESTEPA","INFORMACI\xd3N Y ESTRATEGIA DE DEFENSA","EFECTOS DE SONIDO","M\xdaSICA DE LA ESTEPA","ENCENDIDO","APAGADO","PREFERENCIAS DE NOTIFICACI\xd3N","Alerta de Almac\xe9n Lleno (80%)","Alerta de Cambio de Estaci\xf3n","Alerta de Misi\xf3n Completada","Alerta de Mejora de Yurta Lista","PALETA TEM\xc1TICA NEO-BRUTALISTA","PANTALLA DE GRAN MIGRACI\xd3N","\xc9PICA DE LA ESTEPA (HISTORIA)","RECLAMANDO RECOMPENSA","Reclamando recompensa, por favor espere...","DESGROSE DE GLORIA Y CORONAS","C\xe1lculo de Reinicio de Migraci\xf3n","CAPTURA DE DIORAMA","\xa1Captura de diorama guardada en la galer\xeda!","SELECCI\xd3N DE REINO","\xc1RBOL DE SABIDUR\xcdA T\xd6RE","Sabidur\xeda","Reclamar","Reclamado","Bloqueado","Desbloquear","EQUIPADO","EQUIPAR","ACTIVO","INACTIVO","horas","minutos","segundos","PROPIEDAD","SALVAJE","MATRIZ DE LA ESTEPA","Activando Motor V\xf3xel Isom\xe9trico...","CARGANDO","PIEDRAS BITIG DE ORHON & \xc1RBOL DE SABIDUR\xcdA","BITIG","Log\xedstica","Calefacci\xf3n","Tierra","Fundici\xf3n","DESBLOQUEADO","PEDIDOS DE EMBAJADOR DE LA RUTA DE LA SEDA","No hay pedidos de embajador pendientes en este momento.","ENTREGADO","ENTREGAR PEDIDO","REINO ACTIVO","SELECCIONAR ESTE REINO","MESETAS CELESTIALES DE ALT\xc1I","Abundancia de Minas, Canteras y Acero de Damasco","\u2022 La producci\xf3n de Piedra, Hierro y Acero de Damasco se duplica.\n\u2022 30% de descuento en el costo de conquista de Monta\xf1a y Cr\xe1ter.\n\u2022 Inviernos duros y gran sinergia con el legado Kurgan.","CUENCA DEL R\xcdO VOLGA-URAL","Abundancia de Pesca, Humedales y Yurtas de Kumis","\u2022 La producci\xf3n de Pescado, Comida, Harina y Kumis se duplica.\n\u2022 30% de descuento en el costo de conquista de Mar y Juncales.\n\u2022 +50% de resonancia de prosperidad junto a r\xedos y lagos.","KARAKUM Y OASIS DE TARIM","Caravanas de la Ruta de la Seda, Trueque y Abundancia de Fieltro","\u2022 La velocidad de caravanas, ganancias de trueque y Coronas se duplican.\n\u2022 La producci\xf3n de fieltro y yurtas es 50% m\xe1s r\xe1pida.\n\u2022 25% de descuento en el costo de conquista de Desierto y Oasis.","\xbfCONFIRMAR GRAN MIGRACI\xd3N?","Se reiniciar\xe1n tus tierras y recursos actuales; tu horda migrar\xe1 a una nueva era.\n\nHerencia a ganar:\n\u2022 +{0} Coronas (Puntos de Gloria)\n\u2022 +{1} Tamga Ancestral Permanente\n\u2022 Tus edificios se convertir\xe1n en Kurganes Ancestrales.\n\n\xbfEst\xe1s seguro de continuar?","GRAN MIGRACI\xd3N (PRESTIGIO Y MULTIPLICADOR DE KUT)","Ciclo de Victoria Eterna de la Estepa y Multiplicador de Herencia","HERENCIA PERMANENTE A GANAR EN ESTA MIGRACI\xd3N","DESGLOSE DE HERENCIA Y RECOMPENSAS","JURAMENTOS SAGRADOS (MODIFICADORES DE DESAF\xcdO)","SELECCI\xd3N DE REINO DE EXPEDICI\xd3N","Recursos","VICTORIAS DEL REINO ETERNO:","Estelas R\xfanicas de Orhon (Cultural)","Red de la Gran Ruta de la Seda (Log\xedstica)","Dominio de los 4 Reinos Ancestrales (Geogr\xe1fico)","Juramento de Acero (+15% Gloria)","Impulso a hierro y minas \u2022 Mayor rendimiento de Tamga","Juramento de Escarcha (+15% Gloria)","Resistencia contra inviernos duros y ventiscas Zud","Gran Estepa (Est\xe1ndar)","Praderas, bosques y cuencas minerales equilibradas","Oasis de la Ruta de la Seda","Biomas des\xe9rticos, caravasares y gran comercio","Mesetas de Alt\xe1i","Tundra y aguas termales frente a la helada","Horda no lista para migrar (Requiere Yurta Nv. 5 y 12 Casillas)","Se requiere Yurta Nv. 5 y 12 Casillas para Migrar.","INICIAR GRAN MIGRACI\xd3N","MIGRACI\xd3N BLOQUEADA","SELECCIONADO","GU\xcdA DE MULTIPLICADORES DE MIGRACI\xd3N","RESUMEN DE GANANCIAS TRAS LA MIGRACI\xd3N","Velocidad de Producci\xf3n Global (Kut)","Volumen de Transporte de Obreros","Tamgas Ancestrales Permanentes","Coronas de Gloria a Ganar","Transporte Permanente (+35% / Migraci\xf3n)","Cada Gran Migraci\xf3n aumenta permanentemente la capacidad de carga de todas las chozas de trabajadores y graneros en +35% x Total de Migraciones. La log\xedstica escala autom\xe1ticamente con la producci\xf3n.","Bendici\xf3n de Kut y Multiplicador de Producci\xf3n (Gracia Divina)","La Bendici\xf3n de Kut multiplica directamente la producci\xf3n de TODOS los recursos en el nuevo asentamiento. 1 Tamga = +4% Velocidad, 1 Migraci\xf3n = +5% Kut Permanente, 1 Gran Victoria = +25% Kut.","\xbfC\xf3mo Ganar Multiplicadores y Coronas?","Yurta del Khan: Nv. 5+ desbloquea la migraci\xf3n. Cada 2 niveles = +1 Corona.","Conquista de Tierras: Cada 20 casillas conquistadas y cada Santuario Antiguo (+5 pts) = +1 Tamga Ancestral.","Inversi\xf3n en Edificios: Cada 15 niveles totales = +1 Corona.","Santuarios Antiguos: Cada Santuario descubierto = +1 Corona y aura sagrada de producci\xf3n.","Stock de Prosperidad: Grandes reservas almacenadas (5K - 500K) = +1 a +4 Coronas Extra.","Pescado","Kumis","Fieltro","Acero de Damasco","GANANCIAS FUERA DE L\xcdNEA DE LA ESTEPA","Las ganancias fuera de l\xednea se transfirieron al almac\xe9n.","\xa1Con la bendici\xf3n de la estepa, se transfirieron 2.0x ganancias duplicadas al almac\xe9n!","Correo a Caballo \xc1gil","Ampl\xeda el alcance de transporte de trabajadores en +1 Hex y aumenta la velocidad de caravanas en +25%.","Red de la Ruta de la Seda","Aumenta la sinergia comercial de las caravanas en +50%.","Sistema Postal del Kaganato","Duplica la capacidad de transporte de trabajadores en todo el mapa.","Tejido de Fieltro Grueso","Reduce el costo de le\xf1a para calentar casillas congeladas en un 30% en invierno.","Fuego del Hogar","Aumenta el multiplicador de producci\xf3n invernal de casillas calentadas en +40%.","Resistencia al Zud","Reduce a la mitad la penalizaci\xf3n de producci\xf3n negativa de las ventiscas Zud.","Migraci\xf3n Estacional de Pastos","Duplica la velocidad de regeneraci\xf3n de salud del suelo en praderas en barbecho (2x).","Mejora de Semillas Benditas","Aumenta el rendimiento base de cosecha en todos los campos y huertos en +35%.","Explosi\xf3n de Respiraci\xf3n del Suelo","Triplica el multiplicador de respiraci\xf3n de la tierra descansada (3x).","Mejora de Forja con Fuelles","Aumenta la velocidad de extracci\xf3n de mineral y hierro de las minas en +30%.","Secreto del Acero de Damasco","Aumenta la eficiencia de la fundici\xf3n de Acero de Damasco en +50%.","Arcos y Espadas de Modu Chanyu","Duplica el rendimiento global de todas las estructuras mineras y artesanales (2x).","ECONOM\xcdA","MILITAR","N\xd3MADA","COMOD\xcdN","STOCK ACUMULADO:","ESTABLECER RUTA DE LA SEDA","Origen","CONECTADO","CONECTAR","ERIGIR ESTELA BENG\xdc (+10 Tamga, +25% Kut)","CONECTAR RUTA DE LA SEDA (+10 Tamga, +25% Kut)","UNIFICAR REINOS (+15 Tamga, +25% Kut)","Objetivo: Declarar Victoria Eterna con 500 Sabidur\xeda o 4 Rutas.","OBTENIENDO RECOMPENSA","Obteniendo recompensa, por favor espere...","DIORAMA Y SELLO DEL REINO","DIORAMA DEL KHAGANATO","DIORAMA EN PANTALLA COMPLETA","Conquistado: {0} Casillas","Zuds Superados: {0}","Mayor Rendimiento: {0}","COFRE DE HERENCIA SAGRADA","Aumenta las tamgas ancestrales +1 para empezar la nueva era m\xe1s fuerte.","\xa1TIEMPO DE MIGRAR!","\xa1LLEG\xd3 EL MOMENTO DE LA MIGRACI\xd3N SAGRADA!","Primera era completada \u2022 Crecimiento desacelerado","Tu reino alcanz\xf3 sus primeras fronteras. \xa1Inicia la Gran Migraci\xf3n ahora para ganar Tamgas permanentes!","M\xc1S TARDE","MIGRAR AHORA","DESGLOSE DE GLORIA Y CORONAS","CORONAS ACTUALES","A GANAR EN MIGRACI\xd3N","DETALLES DE C\xc1LCULO DE CORONAS","INCURSI\xd3N DE LA ESTEPA: NIVEL {0}","ENEMIGOS RESTANTES: {0}","CUERNO DE INCURSI\xd3N: NIVEL {0}","Castillo Da\xf1ado (Reparaci\xf3n Requerida)","M\xe1s Alto: Nivel {0}","Desaf\xeda a los Incursores de la Estepa","REPARAR CASTILLO","N\xd3MADA DE LA ESTEPA","CONQUISTADOR DE TIERRAS","COMERCIANTE DE LA SEDA","MAESTRO DEL ZUD","GRAN KHAGAN","G\xd6K TENGR\u0130: BENDICI\xd3N DE LLUVIA","TONYUKUK: RED DE SEDA","TONYUKUK: CAMINOS DE PIEDRA","K\xdcL T\u0130G\u0130N: CORAZ\xd3N VALIENTE","Enviado: {0} \u2022 Recompensa: {1}x Fiebre de Oro ({2} min)"],t.w)
